{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Widget Warriors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A warrior living on your desktop? Yes!</strong><br> Defeat enemies, collect coins, unlock skills, and face off against bosses\u2014<br> all within a portable widget that lives right on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever you're doing on your computer \u2014 this tiny but mighty widget warrior interprets every keystroke as an attack.<br> The more you type, the faster you grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682070/extras/06dc3ded7a6730c8ff520696aec7d349.poster.avif?t=1757427664\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682070/extras/06dc3ded7a6730c8ff520696aec7d349.webm?t=1757427664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682070/extras/06dc3ded7a6730c8ff520696aec7d349.mp4?t=1757427664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight with every keystroke</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every key you press triggers an attack.<br> Whether you're browsing, working, or gaming \u2014 your warrior keeps fighting in the background.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682070/extras/7a2597e28daf7238f8c2a5ace6625df2.poster.avif?t=1757427664\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682070/extras/7a2597e28daf7238f8c2a5ace6625df2.webm?t=1757427664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682070/extras/7a2597e28daf7238f8c2a5ace6625df2.mp4?t=1757427664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock and customize your skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the coins you collect to unlock powerful active and passive skills.<br> Want to change your playstyle? Unlock new characters with unique attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682070/extras/ba4d42870c9c86a0cfa3c9de065704e2.poster.avif?t=1757427664\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682070/extras/ba4d42870c9c86a0cfa3c9de065704e2.webm?t=1757427664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682070/extras/ba4d42870c9c86a0cfa3c9de065704e2.mp4?t=1757427664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless waves, scaling difficulty, and boss battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies grow stronger with each wave.<br> At the end of every stage, prepare for a challenging boss fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682070/extras/1e1d9125a2a0d855b55f2c1d4bf0cf7d.poster.avif?t=1757427664\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682070/extras/1e1d9125a2a0d855b55f2c1d4bf0cf7d.webm?t=1757427664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682070/extras/1e1d9125a2a0d855b55f2c1d4bf0cf7d.mp4?t=1757427664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Portable, resizable desktop widget</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the widget anywhere on your desktop and resize it however you like.<br> Keep it small and subtle in the corner, or go full-screen\u2014it\u2019s up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682070/extras/926385bfd240d18f21a6af5c7603198d.avif?t=1757427664\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682070/extras_big/926385bfd240d18f21a6af5c7603198d.avif?t=1757427664 width=800 height=370 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Daily \u201cKey of the Day\u201d event</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, a randomly chosen key grants bonus damage when pressed.<br> A small but fun daily surprise that adds variety to your sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682070?t=1757427664","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682070?t=1757427664","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682070/6d153a6fd060cd5237174ff446295bafc04a75f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757427664","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682070/6d153a6fd060cd5237174ff446295bafc04a75f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757427664","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Widget Warriors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A warrior living on your desktop? Yes!</strong><br> Defeat enemies, collect coins, unlock skills, and face off against bosses\u2014<br> all within a 